    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "Robin Williams Wrote this one \"for all the people who now need to design pages, but who have no background or formal training in design\". Follow the basic principles clearly explained in this book and your work is guaranteed to look more professional, organized, unified, and interesting. You'll never again look at a page in the same way. Full of practical design exercises and quizzes. Runner-up for Best Introductory Systems How-to Book in the 10th Annual Computer Press Awards."
